  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening People-Centric and Inclusive Access to Justice in Bhutan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to strengthen inclusive access to justice and promote awareness of rights-based approaches for the justice sector and civil society actors. The two specific objectives are: 1. Enhancing the accessibility and inclusivity of justice and legal aid services, through building the capacities and institutional mechanisms of the justice sector and oversight bodies. 2. Enhancing the public and CSOs&#x2019; awareness, engagement and capacities towards fostering fundamental</narrative>
  </description>
